Our changes to the verl fork, relative to Thinking-Space/Rethinking-OPD (formerly thunlp/OPD)
at ac26e38d6f1572eb027597b48a9f4e01f6915ef8, whose verl/ subtree is unchanged since c6cd96b15e.

Documentation only: third_party/verl/ already contains these changes. Paths are relative to the
verl project root (Rethinking-OPD's verl/ directory, i.e. third_party/verl/), so the patch applies
with `patch -p1 -d <Rethinking-OPD>/verl < verl_vs_rethinking_opd_ac26e38.patch`.

Change numbers follow THIRD_PARTY.md:
  dp_actor.py      1 chunked/checkpointed top-k log_softmax (FINAL), 2 2-D entropy kept (FINAL),
                   3 3-D log_prob kept (FINAL)
  ray_trainer.py   4 token ledger/budget (opt-in)

Every other file under third_party/verl/ is byte-identical to the verl tree the final runs
used, whose verl/verl/ package in turn equals Rethinking-OPD@ac26e38 verl/verl/ file for file
except dp_actor.py (change 1 above).

